WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:01.869
(dramatic music)

00:00:01.869 --> 00:00:04.619
(waves crashing)

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:25.418
- [Narrator] The Galician coast
line in Northern Spain is

00:00:25.418 --> 00:00:28.928
home to one of the most expensive
delicacies in the world.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:32.298
Percebes, or goose barnacles,
grow on the sides of rocks

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:36.458
in the treacherous waters
of the Atlantic ocean.

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:39.738
Barnacle hunting has long
been considered a man's job

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:43.517
but in Baiona, a town along the
coast where hundreds of families

00:00:43.517 --> 00:00:45.106
make a living off the ocean,

00:00:45.106 --> 00:00:49.273
some of the best barnacle
hunters or percebeiros are women.

00:01:51.158 --> 00:01:54.739
- [Narrator] Percebes hunting
is not for the faint of heart.

00:01:54.739 --> 00:01:57.837
Every year there are hundreds
of accidents along the coast,

00:01:57.837 --> 00:02:02.004
but, for the González sisters,
the risk is worth it.

00:02:24.438 --> 00:02:26.486
- [Narrator] Part of Xosé’s
job is to keep watch over

00:02:26.486 --> 00:02:28.903
the percebeiros while they are working.

00:02:28.903 --> 00:02:30.984
There have been numerous
fatal accidents in Baiona

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:33.882
over the past decade but
Xosé has been able to save

00:02:33.882 --> 00:02:36.215
the lives of 10 percebeiros.

00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:44.487
- [Narrator] Three years ago,
Belén González had a career

00:02:44.487 --> 00:02:46.885
ending accident when she
slipped on a patch of seaweed

00:02:46.885 --> 00:02:48.847
and fell into the rocks.

00:02:48.847 --> 00:02:52.065
And recently, Lala, the youngest,
was forced to take a leave

00:02:52.065 --> 00:02:55.076
from the sea after going
through cancer treatments.

00:02:55.076 --> 00:02:58.455
So for now, it's just Susana
and Isabel who hunt together

00:02:58.455 --> 00:03:01.372
keeping the family tradition alive.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.023
- [Narrator] To keep the
number of percebes at a healthy

00:04:02.023 --> 00:04:04.672
level and to prevent over-
fishing, quotas have been

00:04:04.672 --> 00:04:06.589
imposed on the hunters.

00:04:20.622 --> 00:04:22.201
- [Narrator] The sisters
sell their haul at a seafood

00:04:22.201 --> 00:04:26.368
auction that takes place at
Baiona fish market every day.

00:04:42.764 --> 00:04:44.865
- [Narrator] These market
auctions have become a hot spot

00:04:44.865 --> 00:04:47.505
for local chefs and restaurateurs

00:04:47.505 --> 00:04:50.356
like Bernardo Alvarez Miniño
who frequents the market

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:53.689
every week looking for perfect percebes.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:05.998
- [Narrator] Despite the
risks that come with their

00:06:05.998 --> 00:06:08.521
profession, the González sisters take pride

00:06:08.521 --> 00:06:10.478
in carrying on their family’s tradition

00:06:10.478 --> 00:06:13.728
and commitment to working with the sea.

00:06:32.966 --> 00:06:35.799
(dramatic music)

